<title>JAPAN: Kao unit builds China toiletries plant. [CORRECTED 08:12 GMT]</title>
<headline>Kao unit builds China toiletries plant. [CORRECTED 08:12 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and throughout to make clear plant is completed).</p>
<p>Japan's Kao Corp said on Thursday that its subsidiary in China has completed a factory (corrects from &quot;will build a factory&quot;) in Shanghai to produce toiletry products.</p>
</text>
